{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id129740498"}, "name":{"label":"MiluZoe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-02T16:59:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13915988173"}, "title":{"label":"SHADY BILLING - Send the statement below to your bank and dispute the unauthorized charge!"}, "content":{"label":"Dispute Description - Unauthorized Charge (Endel App)\n\nI am disputing a charge of $119.99 from Endel, which I did not knowingly authorize.\n\nI initially downloaded the Endel app with a free trial. However, at no point did I knowingly agree to a paid annual subscription or authorize a $119.99 charge. The app did not provide a clear or accessible way to cancel prior to being charged.\n\nAfter noticing the charge, I took immediate steps to locate and cancel any associated subscription. However, there is no active or past subscription listed under my Apple Subscriptions, which indicates that this charge is not tied to any visible or manageable subscription through my Apple account. This prevented me from canceling or managing the charge through standard channels.\n\nBecause:\n1. I did not knowingly authorize this charge,  \n2. There was no clear or accessible way to cancel the trial before billing, and  \n3. There is no corresponding subscription visible in my account to manage or cancel,  \n\nI believe this charge is unauthorized and request a full refund and investigation into the merchant’s billing practices.\n\nThank you for your assistance in resolving this matter.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
