{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id470267400"}, "name":{"label":"Saleh Mir"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-02T05:17:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.43"}, "id":{"label":"13914047275"}, "title":{"label":"Stops playing after 10 minutes"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app and I was using it every night to go to sleep until I updated yesterday and now after playing for 10 minutes it pauses for no reason. I don't know if this is a new limitation or a bug. I would appreciate it if it was fixed if it is a bug. Either way please let me know what's going on. Thank you.\n\nupdate: \n\nI updated to premium, but no matter how much I click on the restore button or login, still it doesn't recognize me as premium and I'm still stuck with the free limitations. Even worse, it forced me to subscribe to the yearly plan, but still after payment, I cannot use it. I have tried different IP addresses, thinking that maybe the issue is on my side. Please fix this. I also couldn't find any way to contact your support about this either", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
