{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id108739167"}, "name":{"label":"Solipsist01"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-30T17:24:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13905190155"}, "title":{"label":"Deceptive Billing Practices"}, "content":{"label":"As many others have reported, I too activated the trial and thought I had cancelled only to learn that I hadn’t when I got charged $119.99. I submitted a request for a refund through the app but received an auto reply saying that I didn’t qualify for it. As advised, I also visited their website to request a refund and was told I didn’t have an active account. I tried requesting a refund from Apple but they don’t show this as a paid subscription, only the free trial appears on my Apple account from a week ago. Everything about this feels like a giant scam. Next stop is the better business bureau and the State AG.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
