{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1905350868"}, "name":{"label":"Rebaccahila"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-27T21:01:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13894906577"}, "title":{"label":"Weird sounds during sleep"}, "content":{"label":"I otherwise like this app for the sounds. Very effective at helping me and my son fall asleep. The sleep sound, however, has for two nights now randomly had an AI sound in a girls voice say “hi” that woke me up and a few hours later woke me up with a dark, disturbing noise like deep trumpet sound. I turned on a previous sound app after that. Wondering what they’re actually doing to my brain. It’s dunno. Has me wondering. I’m on a trial run. I won’t pay for further weirdness like that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
