{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id202762152"}, "name":{"label":"Bwhast"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-27T06:22:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13892536696"}, "title":{"label":"AirPlay now broken"}, "content":{"label":"I am changing my review from one star to five stars. Endel ‘Sleep’ once again works flawlessly when streaming via AirPlay to my HomePod. Its abysmally fitful AirPlay performance of the past couple of months appears to have been definitively resolved by some software updates — iOS to 26.4, HomePod OS to 26.4, and Endel to 4.7.10. \n  For years, I had played Endel “Sleep” at night on a HomePod via AirPlay from my iPhone. This became no longer reliable. Playback of “Sleep” to the HomePod stopped within 5 minutes. It then might work in fits and starts a couple of times, then cut out completely. My hardware is solid, so this was due solely to Endel software changes. I suspect it is related to Endel periodically “refreshing” its audio session, and that a recent Endel update (or iOS/macOS update) made those refreshes more aggressive. AirPlay is intolerant of this, and just quits.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id823288173"}, "name":{"label":"a13xndra"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-27T04:08:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.43"}, "id":{"label":"13892159402"}, "title":{"label":"THE BEST — Focus on demand!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Endel for years now. It is my go-to for focus and sleep music. I focus so much better with it. I play it all the time. I also love the sleep track when there’s ambient noise. \n\nWhat I love about the Focus music is that I don’t have to control anything—I just set it and it does its thing in the background. I must have spent several months straight cumulatively listening to Endel. Very grateful for this app. Thank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
